<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第三步 · 推演：两条反应曲线的交点</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="462" width="530" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>图 1 · 反应曲线与古诺均衡（横纵轴均以 <formula><latex><![CDATA[(a-c)/b]]></latex></formula> 为单位）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="104" width="316" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>两个反应函数同时成立，解得</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="134" width="316" height="58"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[q_1^{*}=q_2^{*}=\frac{a-c}{3b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="192" width="316" height="58"><content textType="body" fontSize="28" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[p^{*}=\frac{a+2c}{3}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="262" width="316" height="76"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>在这一点，任何一家单独改变产量都会吃亏。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="342" width="316" height="110"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>一百多年后，纳什把这种“谁都不愿单独改变”的状态叫作均衡；古诺均衡是它最早的例子之一。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [3][10] --></p><p>横轴是厂商 1 的产量，纵轴是厂商 2 的产量，两条直线分别是两家的反应函数。</p><p>两条线的交点就是古诺均衡：每家生产 (a − c)/3b，总产量是 2(a − c)/3b，价格是 (a + 2c)/3。</p><p>可以带学生走一遍“调整过程”：从任意一点出发，两家交替按反应曲线移动，会逐步收敛到交点。</p></content></note></slide>